<title>USA: Traders say CBOT T-bond trade halts amid glitch.</title>
<headline>Traders say CBOT T-bond trade halts amid glitch.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Treasury bond futures trading at the Chicago Board of Trade halted shortly after the open this morning due to a technical problem, traders said.</p>
<p>They said the floor had been told that they would be given a 10 minute warning before trade would re-open.</p>
<p>A CBOT official said &quot;there are a number people looking into it&quot; and did not elaborate.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Deriavtives Desk (312) 408-8750))</p>
